  "checks": [
    "Generated and producer-reopened R13 and R14 drawings with distinct RESEARCH/CHECK/37 and SECOND/OTHER/73 records. LibreDWG plus an independent bit/frame walker checked class, CRCs, handles, dictionary roles, values, following frames and changed-length rejection with original retry.",
    "The actual adapter source-binding test mutates the parent, each child value and raw frame, each edge, class, duplicate name/target, and an extra third entry; it verifies refusal, unchanged destination and corrected retry. A prior one-entry R13 control also passes.",
    "The scratch-only legacy guard bypass exercises staged dictionary, XRECORD and role failures followed by same-adapter retries in ASCII and binary for R13 and R14. Independent ezdxf 1.4.5 readback validates all sixteen resulting graphs, entity geometry, and zero audit errors/fixes.",
    "A second scratch-only fault targets only the OTHER child, proving its staged body mismatch is detected independently of the first child; unchanged destinations and corrected retries pass for both releases and encodings.",
    "Production adapter rejects both drawings in ASCII and binary without changing destination. Six focused CTests pass. A second pinned R13 generator run is byte-identical."
  ],
